---
description: >-
  Sales Revenue bar+line chart with showTitle set to false on both the
  x-axis and y-axis, verifying axis titles ("Months", "Revenue (in $)")
  can be hidden while tick labels, ticks, and the axis line remain visible.
config:
  xyChart:
    xAxis:
      showTitle: false
    yAxis:
      showTitle: false
---
xychart
  title "Sales Revenue"
  x-axis Months [jan, feb, mar, apr, may, jun, jul, aug, sep, oct, nov, dec]
  y-axis "Revenue (in $)" 4000 --> 11000
  bar [5000, 6000, 7500, 8200, 9500, 10500, 11000, 10200, 9200, 8500, 7000, 6000]
  line [5000, 6000, 7500, 8200, 9500, 10500, 11000, 10200, 9200, 8500, 7000, 6000]
